git-khronos (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Scale the interface automatically to the screen, so 100% is the detected default.
  * Match the WSL title bar and startup surfaces to the selected theme.
  * Ship the launcher as git-khronos.desktop so WSLg groups the window with its pin.
  * Rename remaining Chronos references to Khronos.

